          "type": "BODY",
          "text": "{{1}}, your {{2}} at {{3}} is reserved until {{4}} WAT. Total: NGN {{5}} for {{6}} guests. Open your booking link to check the current status and pay if the hold remains active.",
          "example": {
            "body_text": [
              [
                "Amaka",
                "Table 12",
                "Demo Lounge",
                "9:42 PM",
